# Date Picker - Select 7 Days Prior Date

## Description
This Selenium automation script selects a date that is **7 days before the current system date** from the jQuery Date Picker.

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Selenium WebDriver
- ChromeDriver
- LocalDate (Java Time API)

## Logic
1. Get the current system date.
2. Subtract 7 days using `LocalDate.now().minusDays(7)`.
3. Extract the month, year, and day.
4. Navigate to the required month and year in the calendar.
5. Select the calculated date.

## Code Used
```java
LocalDate targetDate = LocalDate.now().minusDays(7);

String month = targetDate.getMonth().getDisplayName(TextStyle.FULL, Locale.ENGLISH);
String year = String.valueOf(targetDate.getYear());
String date = String.valueOf(targetDate.getDayOfMonth());
```

## Example

Current Date: 28-07-2026

Selected Date: 21-07-2026

## Features
- Automatically calculates the date 7 days before the current date.
- Works across different months and years.
- No hardcoded dates required.
